  "goal": "Build loop 2 \u2014 the machine learning about itself operating (the self-knowledge layer): (s1) the SESSION SPINE \u2014 session open retrieves the last sessions close record (decisions, open threads, parked items), session close writes this sessions (waves run, merged, parked, what the AIO got wrong); (s2) DECISION RECORDS with rationale at the moment of decision (promote/publish/approve emit what + why + the alternatives weighed); (s3) WAVE-VERDICT narratives emitted at run completion (what happened and why, derived from the ledger \u2014 never re-derived by grep); (s4) BELIEF RECORDS with the update protocol \u2014 n_confirm/n_disconfirm/posterior, seeded from the measured history (flash converges fast on in-process, container seams take waves, adversarial reviews catch wiring gaps); (s5) the measured SCOREBOARD (waves, merge rate, cost/wave, adversarial-finding rate); (s6) REFLECTIONS \u2014 a session-keyed series each session appends to; all records carry their ACTOR + SCOPE per the context abstraction (AIO-scoped, workload-scoped, org-root; the supervisor rail separate; cell agents never resolve the AIO private records); then the pro adversarial review (probing that a cell scope cannot resolve AIO records) and the harness gate.",
